fafstmobel - Cinference

Installer recipe
----------------
Adapted from Fast Long Context - Cinference:
https://github.com/satellitedown/fast-long-context-cinference
The recipe has been changed to download fafstmobel and its complete published
license/provenance bundle, use its own model ID and port, and expose its bundled
DFlash2, vision, and host-cache serving profile. The original recipe's model
performance claims and screenshot are not applicable to this derivative.

This repository provides an Apache-2.0 installation recipe. It does not
redistribute model weights. Its license does not replace the licenses of
downloaded software or model artifacts.

Runtime
-------
Cinference, the modified NInfer runtime used by this recipe:
https://github.com/satellitedown/cinference
NInfer, by the Neroued/ninfer contributors:
https://github.com/Neroued/ninfer
The immutable runtime revision is recorded in runtime-manifest.json.
Native executable names, API symbols and the .ninfer container name remain
NInfer names. This recipe builds the pinned fork without applying local
source patches. Retain its license and third-party notices.

Model artifact and transformation
---------------------------------
fafstmobel: https://huggingface.co/satellitedown/fafstmobel
Revision: 54202e174c5f05945fbb873d1c2d8384e2643bd3

The downloaded NInfer v3 artifact is a derivative of the upstream weights
listed below. Its published transformation notice describes:
  1. delta transplant: result = swift.float() + (huihui.float() - base.float()),
     rounded once to bfloat16, applied only to language-model decoder layer
     weights that differ between the base and Huihui checkpoints;
  2. text quantization to NVFP4/FP8 with a local calibration pass;
  3. conversion to NInfer v3, bundling the published DFlash2 draft as a
     separate component alongside text, vision and MTP.

No Swift retraining, new draft-model training, or re-fitting of a refusal
direction was performed by that transformation. The installer only downloads
and verifies the published artifact; it does not modify weights.

